description:
Implement `useAbortFetch` — a hook that wraps `fetch` with an `AbortController`, automatically cancelling the previous request when a new one is made.

**Example:**
```tsx
const { fetch: abortFetch, abort, isLoading } = useAbortFetch();
// Calling abortFetch again while loading aborts the previous request
```

